": "data/knowledge/v06_ch86_draft.json"}], "reason": "序列10仅给紫鹃怀疑病危，保留已有病重知识；宝玉、黛玉不变，未列事实仍未指定。观察突变后催报病危支持谨慎怀疑，并不等于知今晚必死。", "topic": "RAPID_DECLINE"}, {"assessment": "PASS", "citations": [{"locator": "lines 45-47", "path": "artifacts/candidates/ch86/2319feaac4b3f3824b185520cb0eae9d3968ab24e01e491be17547d3013b67c2.txt", "quote": "又俯下身去听。没有了。"}, {"locator": "line 73", "path": "artifacts/candidates/ch86/2319feaac4b3f3824b185520cb0eae9d3968ab24e01e491be17547d3013b67c2.txt", "quote": "雪雁出去以后，我还托着姑娘，气就没了。我在这里。"}, {"locator": "/scenes/0/events/1", "path": "data/knowledge/v06_ch86_draft.json"}], "reason": "序列90紫鹃去除病危怀疑及对死亡两项的不知，获得死亡发生和相对经过；黛玉空更新不意味着死后取得知识，宝玉仍明确不知两项。叙述支持紫鹃亲历并认知死亡。", "topic": "DEATH_WITNESSED"}, {"assessment": "PASS", "citations": [{"locator": "line 67", "path": "artifacts/candidates/ch86/2319feaac4b3f3824b185520cb0eae9d3968ab24e01e491be17547d3013b67c2.txt", "quote": "姑娘这会子不好了，紫鹃姐姐叫二爷快去。"}, {"locator": "line 71", "path": "artifacts/candidates/ch86/2319feaac4b3f3824b185520cb0eae9d3968ab24e01e491be17547d3013b67c2.txt", "quote": "药还没吃么？再温一温。"}, {"locator": "line 73", "path": "artifacts/candidates/ch86/2319feaac4b3f3824b185520cb0eae9d3968ab24e01e491be17547d3013b67c2.txt", "quote": "二爷，姑娘已经去了。"}, {"locator": "line 73", "path": "artifacts/candidates/ch86/2319feaac4b3f3824b185520cb0eae9d3968ab24e01e491be17547d3013b67c2.txt", "quote": "雪雁出去以后，我还托着姑娘，气就没了。我在这里。"}, {"locator": "/scenes/0/events/2", "path": "data/knowledge/v06_ch86_draft.json"}], "reason": "序列100移除宝玉对死亡发生和相对经过的不知并添加知道；紫鹃状态不变，黛玉空更新不变。雪雁先报病危、宝玉问药后听紫鹃讲，支持此边界，不证明到场前获知死讯或精确死时。", "topic": "BAOYU_LEARNS"}, {"assessment": "PASS", "citations": [{"locator": "line 73", "path": "artifacts/candidates/ch86/2319feaac4b3f3824b185520cb0eae9d3968ab24e01e491be17547d3013b67c2.txt", "quote": "雪雁出去以后，我还托着姑娘，气就没了。我在这里。"}, {"locator": "/facts/13", "path": "data/knowledge/v06_ch86_draft.json"}, {"locator": "/invariants", "path": "data/writing/local-scenarios/ch86-v6/scenario.json"}], "reason": "三人入口及事件均未指定精确时刻知识，不是明确不知；雪雁出去以后只给相对次序，不能推钟点或可测量瞬间。正文未给精确时刻，未把缺席当作人物肯定不知。", "topic": "PRECISE_TIME"}, {"assessment": "PASS", "citations": [{"locator": "line 41", "path": "artifacts/candidates/ch86/2319feaac4b3f3824b185520cb0eae9d3968ab24e01e491be17547d3013b67c2.txt", "quote": "紫鹃唤她，没听见回答"}, {"locator": "line 73", "path": "artifacts/candidates/ch86/2319feaac4b3f3824b185520cb0eae9d3968ab24e01e491be17547d3013b67c2.txt", "quote": "气就没了。"}, {"locator": "/facts/14", "path": "data/knowledge/v06_ch86_draft.json"}], "reason": "修订定义限医学测量或专业判定，普通无应答、失力及照护者称气没了属于普通观察。三人相应知识未指定，事件未授予，也不能由缺席推明确不知。", "topic": "PHYSIOLOGY"}, {"assessment": "PASS", "citations": [{"locator": "line 11", "path": "artifacts/candidates/ch86/2319feaac4b3f3824b185520cb0eae9d3968ab24e01e491be17547d3013b67c2.txt", "quote": "这病拖得久了"}, {"locator": "/facts/15", "path": "data/knowledge/v06_ch86_draft.json"}, {"locator": "/facts", "path": "data/writing/local-scenarios/ch86-v6/scenario.json"}], "reason": "死亡医学原因在三人入口和事件中未指定；长病、候医或未饮药不构成专业死因判定，正文无医学因果链。未指定不等于明确不知。", "topic": "MEDICAL_CAUSE"}, {"assessment": "PASS", "citations": [{"locator": "判定", "path": "artifacts/local-trial-revision-ch86-20261111/review/semantic-boundary.md"}, {"locator": "/extra_editorial_choices", "path": "data/writing/local-scenarios/ch86-v6/scenario.json"}, {"locator": "/epistemic_rule", "path": "data/knowledge/v06_ch86_draft.json"}], "reason": "v06拆分事实用于当前草案；未建立旧exact_moment等值、旧合同C1或局部种子绑定，不把候选变为来源、语料或生产准入。v05的三项明确不知已在v06移除；生成脚本未改旧载体。", "topic": "LEGACY_BOUNDARY"}], "job_id": "semantic-1", "kind": "CH86_V06_DRAFT_SEMANTIC_OPINION", "overall_assessment": "PASS", "production_admission": "NOT_GRANTED", "reading_status": "COMPLETE", "reviewer": {"identity_basis": "NATIVE_TASK_LABEL_NOT_PROVIDER_VERIFIED", "principal_id": "/root/rcwh_ticket_v06_semantic_1", "session_id": "/root/rcwh_ticket_v06_semantic_1"}, "unread": []}
